# Take the Fall with no outlaw among Bot1's permanents: "Target creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn" (CR 611.2a). Bot2's Mox Jet is
# not a creature and is refused as the target (CR 115.1); Bot2's Grizzly Bears is the one accepted and becomes 1/2 for the turn.
# Bot1 draws a card (CR 121.1), so its hand is back to seven (Mox Sapphire cast, Take the Fall cast, turn 3's draw and the spell's).
# The effect ends at the cleanup step (CR 514.2): on turn 4 the Bears is a 2/2 again.

